		(property "Description" "Alps SKSCLCE010 side-push SMT SPST-NO; 3.5x3.55x1.25 mm body, 1.6 N, 0.2 mm travel, 12 V DC 50 mA max, 1 V DC 10 uA min (verify low-level contact at the ~20 uA BQ_QON operating point), -30...+85 C, 100k cycles. Terminals {1,2} and {3,4} are internally paired nodes. Two devices share one external actuator; KEY_POWER_MCU and BQ_QON stay electrically separate. Actuator datum and pair spacing are provisional engineering choices pending M0."
